  - ID: SC_32
    Category: "Ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng Nh\xE1nh"
    Context: "Ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng 1.4: T\u1EBF \u0111\xE0n Ch\xFAc ph\xFAc &
