  - ID: SC_35
    Category: "S\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n Nh\xE1nh"
    Context: "3. Nh\xE1nh 2: S\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n C\xE1 c\u01B0\u1EE3c"
    Speaker: "Th\xE1nh V\u1EADt"
    Text: "C\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xE0ng nhi\u1EC1u l\xF5i t\u1EC9 l\u1EC7 rinh Buff Hi\u1EBFm
      c\xE0ng cao! Th\u1EAFng th\xEC bay n\xF3c nh\xE0, c\xF2n thua th\xEC... nh\u1EADn
