    IsPlayer: 0
  - ID: SC_38
    Category: "S\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n Nh\xE1nh"
    Context: "3. Nh\xE1nh 2: S\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n C\xE1 c\u01B0\u1EE3c"
    Speaker: "Ph\xE1p S\u01B0"
    Text: "G\xE1y to l\xEAn anh em \u01A1i! Tay t\u1ED5 c\u1EDD b\u1EA1c l\xE0 \u0111\xE2y
