      Th\u01B0\u1EDDng"
    Speaker: "Ph\xE1p S\u01B0"
    Text: "R\xF5 nh\u01B0 ban ng\xE0y! Match \u0111\xE1 ch\u01B0\u1EDFng ngay l\u1EADp
      t\u1EE9c, t\u1ED1n 5 mana m\u1ED7i ph\xE1t. H\u1EBFt mana tr\u1EABm b\u1EA5m
      Skip \u0111\u1ED5i l\u01B0\u1EE3t li\u1EC1n, chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB ngh\xEAnh chi\u1EBFn!"
    AnimationNote: "Th\u1EE7 th\u1EBF tr\u01B0\u1EE3ng ph\xE9p, m\u1EAFt b\u1ED1c
      l\u1EEDa quy\u1EBFt t\xE2m; Banner 'B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u' s\xE1ng r\u1EF1c,
      b\xE0n Match Stone tr\u01B0\u1EE3t l\xEAn."
    IsPlayer: 1
  - ID: SC_43
    Category: "M\u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u Trong Wave"
    Context: "5. Banner Wave Chi\u1EBFn \u0110\u1EA5u: Ch\u1EA1m tr\xE1n Boss Wave"
    Speaker: "Th\xE1nh V\u1EADt"
    Text: "\xC1i ch\xE0 ch\xE0! Boss Wave xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n t\u1ECFa aura t\xEDm
      r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1! Coi ch\u1EEBng n\xF3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      l\u1EDBn v\xE0 c\xF3 h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 h\u1ED3i sinh qu\xE1i c\xF9ng h\u1EC7
      ph\xEDa sau!"
    AnimationNote: "Camera lia c\u1EADn c\u1EA3nh Boss Wave; hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng s\u1EA5m
      s\xE9t ch\u1EDBp nh\xE1y \u0111e d\u1ECDa, c\xF2i b\xE1o \u0111\u1ED9ng kh\u1EA9n
      c\u1EA5p."
    IsPlayer: 0
  - ID: SC_44
    Category: "M\u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u Trong Wave"
    Context: "5. Banner Wave Chi\u1EBFn \u0110\u1EA5u: Ch\u1EA1m tr\xE1n Boss Wave"
    Speaker: "Ph\xE1p S\u01B0"
    Text: "C\u0103ng \u0111\u1EA5y nh\u01B0ng tr\u1EABm th\xEDch! T\u1EADp trung
