      d\u1ED3n combo ti\u1EC5n Boss v\u1EC1 v\u01B0\u1EDDn! B\u1EADt banner B\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u1EA7u chi\u1EBFn n\xE0o!"
    AnimationNote: "Vung g\u1EADy ma ph\xE1p v\u1EBD \u1EA5n ch\xFA uy l\u1EF1c;
      chibi nghi\u1EBFn r\u0103ng t\u1EF1 tin; Banner 'B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u' b\xF9ng
      ch\xE1y s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng v\xE0o tr\u1EADn."
    IsPlayer: 1
  - ID: SC_45
    Category: "M\u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u Trong Wave"
